you'll disappear for good?

250
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:51,317
If that's what it'll take to
save my life, then so be it!

251
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,540
Enough talk!

252
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,899
Make your throw now or you're dead!

253
00:15:59,940 --> 00:16:00,860
Alright, yeah!

254
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:03,457
This will be way easier
with the sun obscured!

255
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:05,893
I can see it coming straight down to me!

256
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:10,330
No!

257
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:18,680
Look at that! How cute!

258
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:21,666
All the little birdies
want to join the party!

259
00:16:35,180 --> 00:16:36,010
Oh yeah!

260
00:16:36,093 --> 00:16:37,040
Did you see me?

261
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:41,820
That there was the second one in the
can! Boom! That's right! I'm on a roll!

262
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:44,497
Man, I can't believe I thought
this was gonna be difficult,

263
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:46,157
but I'm getting the hang of it!

264
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,240
I can win!

265
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:48,577
Nothing can stop me now!

266
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:51,437
Feel free to celebrate
as much as your rotten

267
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:54,285
little heart desires
after we're actually done.

268
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,600
It's time for the final throw!

269
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:58,080
Go ahead, asshole!

270
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,697
Smack those hands together!

271
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:00,940
Just one more...

272
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,600
What the hell?

273
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:20,297
You're screaming rather loud for someone
who brought this down upon himself.

274
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:24,197
What did you think was going to happen when
you scattered that whole bag of popcorn?

275
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,740
Just look at your face!

276
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:29,660
This is it.

277
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,120
The last one.

278
00:17:31,660 --> 00:17:34,440
If I throw it higher
than the street lamp...

279
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:38,400
You greedy bastards! Get out of here!

280
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,480
I'm all out!

281
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:40,935
There's nothing left!

282
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:42,100
It's time.

283
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:45,560
Make your last throw!
Ah! Wait! Just a second!

284
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,860
How's that?

285
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:01,278
Those stupid pigeons won't
go anywhere near the fire!

286
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:03,120
I oiled it up and lit it!

287
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:05,126
Worked like a freakin' charm!

288
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:06,698
Home stretch, baby!

289
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:09,094
Pack your bags and get ready to bounce!

290
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,150
Huh?

291
00:18:16,233 --> 00:18:17,063
A flame!

292
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:19,620
Where did it go? Damn it!

293
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:22,275
The sunlight's completely engulfed it!

294
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:23,560
This is bad!

295
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:27,000
I can't see it! No! Where'd it go?

296
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,260
Destiny has spoken.

297
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:43,955
Looks like you did deserve
to lose your head after all.

298
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:07,857
You're wondering how I'm sitting
here, speaking with you right now,

299
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:09,480
aren't you, Father?

300
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:14,140
You see, it's the same
reason for my visit today.

301
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:19,660
I cannot bear it myself any longer,
that despicable sin I've committed.

302
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,777
The spirit of that vagrant,

303
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:27,820
he'd made me so rich that virtually
nothing was outside my grasp.

304
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:32,749
It took almost no effort to find a
servant who would do anything I commanded.

305
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,500
Master, come out of there, please.

306
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:48,380
Master, I've told you, no matter how many
times you confess, I will never leave you.

307
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:05,520
You who paid me off to surgically
discard my old face and take on yours,

308
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:08,217
only to throw me into the maw of such a

309
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:11,300
terrifying nightmare without
even a second thought.

310
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:13,260
I will never forgive you.

311
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:16,360
I will bear this grudge
till the end of time.

312
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,602
So you're able to follow
me even into the church?

313
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:26,300
Listen closely to my words.

314
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:27,837
The day which your sweet,

315
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,357
dear daughter cherishes
more than any other

316
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:33,264
will be the day that I
come to exact my revenge.

317
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:36,451
Can't let him out of your sight till then.

318
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:40,157
Otherwise, he'll just cook up
another one of those dirty tricks.

319
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:43,769
Wherever you may tread, we'll
be one step behind you always!

320
00:21:02,140 --> 00:21:02,970
Whoa!

321
00:21:03,053 --> 00:21:05,080
Now that's scary! Uh, Okuyasu?

322
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,400
And Yukako?

323
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:10,640
Yo, Rohan-sensei, was that really
a true story you just told us?

324
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:14,240
Excuse me, can I get a
thing of Baby tea over here?

325
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:16,537
When did you show up exactly?

326
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:19,680
and to so shamelessly accuse me of lying.

327
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:20,780
Hang on.

328
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,677
Nobody said you were lying.

329
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:25,137
I just think it's way more
likely that those spooky,

330
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:28,817
angry ghost things were stand users
rather than vengeful spirits or whatever,

331
00:21:28,900 --> 00:21:29,730
you know?

332
00:21:29,813 --> 00:21:32,257
Well, either way, they're
remarkably patient.

333
00:21:32,340 --> 00:21:35,497
Man, I can't imagine having ghosts
haunt me for the rest of my life.

334
00:21:35,580 --> 00:21:36,756
That's way too much.

335
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:41,597
Hey, Koichi, you'll have to tell me
right away if that ever happens to you.

336
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:44,677
I'll come banish the mean ghost
before it lays a finger on you.

337
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:47,600
Oh, thank you.

338
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:56,620
What's become of that man since?

339
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:59,660
I, Rohan Kishibe, have yet to discover.

340
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:03,577
I should give some thought
to paying him another visit.

341
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:06,640
Perhaps next year, or the year after.

342
00:22:07,460 --> 00:22:11,080
He kept on walking, even with
those specters trailing him.

343
00:22:11,520 --> 00:22:13,480
Alone, yet undeterred.

344
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:18,860
His may not have been a good heart,
but he is undeniably resilient.

345
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:25,160
And it might be that I am the only
one who thinks that about him.

346
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:53,897
I want to know the truth.

347
00:22:53,980 --> 00:22:56,637
Of life that never melts.

348
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:59,317
To chain a mystic rise.

349
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,417
I'm coming.

350
00:23:01,500 --> 00:23:04,737
I'm on my way to find.

351
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:06,737
Eternal varieties.

352
00:23:06,820 --> 00:23:09,897
Expanding all their tears.

353
00:23:09,980 --> 00:23:11,277
By the sun.

354
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:18,037
I can feel my heart beating.

355
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:23,557
I can see my faith all spinning.

356
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:27,580
Long beyond the dark.

357
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:34,097
Rise up to the sky like a butterfly.

358
00:23:34,180 --> 00:23:37,237
Show me what's inside.

359
00:23:37,320 --> 00:23:39,837
I don't know the world's cold.

360
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:43,497
Shining stars will guide me to.

361
00:23:43,580 --> 00:23:45,197
Somewhere high.

362
00:23:45,280 --> 00:23:46,957
Finding the truth.

363
00:23:47,040 --> 00:23:49,680
Beyond the heaven's door.

364
00:24:13,340 --> 00:24:14,760
Thank you.

365
00:24:41,140 --> 00:24:42,500
Thank you.
